<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">RRK61.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETERO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha y'okubanza eyaahandiikirwe Petero</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petero</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA Y'OKUBANZA EYAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETERO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 1:1">Yak 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Petero, entumwa ya Yesu Kristo, naabahandiikira imwe abaanyagirwe, mukataataanira omuri Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Asia na Bitunia, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Heb 12:24</ref>. </char></note> abaatoorainwe Ruhanga Isheboona, nk'oku yaabamanyire ira, mukeezibwa Omwoyo, ngu mworobere Yesu Kristo, kandi ngu mumiisiirwe eshagama ye. Embabazi n'obusingye bikanye omuriimwe.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugasho oguri omu kugyezibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ruhanga, Ishe wa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, asiimwe! Ahabw'embabazi ze nyingi akatuzaara obwa kabiri ngu tugire amatsiko agatahwaho ahabw'okuzooka omu bafu kwa Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />ngu tutungye obuhunguzi obutarikubaasa kuhwerekyerera, obutarikusiisikara, kandi obutarikuhunduuka, obwababiikiirwe omu iguru, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:5">1 Kor 2:5</ref>. </char></note> imwe abarindwa amaani ga Ruhanga ahabw'okwikiriza, murindiirwe okujunwa okurishuuruurwa aha kiro ky'aha mperu. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:11">Heb 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:2">Yak 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo nimubishemerererwa, n'obu muraabe hati mushemereire kumara akaanya kakye nimushaasha ahabw'okugyezibwa okw'emiringo mingi, ku kiraabe nikyetengwa, <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 17:3">Enf 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:12">1 Pet 4:12</ref>. </char></note> ngu okwikiriza kwanyu kuhamibwe ku kuri okw'amazima, kandi ku kurikukiza ezaabu obuguzi bwingi (mumanye ngu ezaabu, n'obu eraabe eri erikuhwaho, ehamibwa yaagyezibwa omu muriro) kandi okugyezibwa kw'okwikiriza kwanyu kubareetere okusiimwa n'ekitiinisa n'okuhimbisibwa aha kushuuruurwa kwa Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:29">Yoh 20:29</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mumukunda, mutakamureebaga; kandi n'obu muraabe mutarikumureeba hati, nimumwikiriza, mumushemerererwa n'okwesiima okutarikubaasa kushoboororwa okwine ekitiinisa kingi, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />nimuheebwa okujunwa kw'amagara gaanyu, nk'ebihembo by'okwikiriza kwanyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:17">Mat 13:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eby'okujunwa okwo baanabi abaaragwire eby'embabazi ezi mwabaire nimwija kuheebwa, bakeezirika kubisherura n'okubishobooroza, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:26">Luk 24:26</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:27">27</ref>. </char></note> nibabuuza obunaku n'obumanyiso bwabwo oku buri, obu baayorekirwe Omwoyo wa Kristo owaabaire ari omuribo, naabamanyisa obusaasi bwa Kristo butakabaireho, n'ekitiinisa ekiribaho bwanyima y'ebyo. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Kandi nabo bakashuuruurirwa, baamanya ngu ti habw'abo bonka, kureka n'ahabwanyu, baaragura ebigambo, ebi mugambiirwe omu biro ebi abantu abaababuuriire ebigambo birungi ahabw'Omwoyo Orikwera owaatumirwe naaruga omu iguru; kandi ebigambo ebyo na baamaraika nibeetenga kubyetegyereza.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwera ahabw'okucungurwa eshagama ya Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luk 12:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mwezirikye mugume emitima, mwerinde, mute amatsiko gaanyu aha mbabazi eziribareeterwa aha kiro ky'Okushuuruurwa kwa Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:3">Efe 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Mube nk'abaana abarikuhurira, mutashushanisibwa nk'oku mwabaire muri, nimukurata okwetenga okubi omu butamanya bwanyu obwa ira; <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />kureka nk'ogwo owaabeetsire oku ari orikwera, naimwe mube nikwo mwaba abarikwera omu micwe yaanyu yoona; <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />ahakuba kikahandiikwa ngu: Muryaba abarikwera, ahabw'okuba nyowe ndi orikwera. <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:6">Mal 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku muraatakire Ogwo nka Shoimwe, ocwera omuntu weena orubanja orushemereire ebi yaakozire, atarikweta aha kitiinisa kye, mumare ebiro by'obushuhuuki bwanyu nimutiina. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:20">1 Kor 6:20</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ku mutaracunguziibwe bintu ebihwaho nk'efeeza n'ezaabu okuruga omu micwe yaanyu etaine mugasho ei mwahungwire ahari baashwenkuriimwe, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:14">Heb 9:14</ref>. </char></note> kureka Kristo akabacungura n'eshagama ye ey'obuguzi bwingi, nk'ey'omwana gw'entaama ogutaine kamogo n'obu ryakuba eibara; <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />owaamanyirwe ira ensi etakahangirwe, kwonka akoorekwa omu bunaku bw'aha mperu ahabwanyu, <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:24">Rom 4:24</ref>. </char></note> imwe abu yaahaire okwikiriza Ruhanga, owaamuzoire omu bafu, akamuha ekitiinisa, ngu okwikiriza kwanyu n'amatisko gaanyu bibe omuri Ruhanga.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 5:1">1 Yoh 5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nk'oku muherize kweza amagara gaanyu omu kworobera amazima, ngu mubone kukunda ab'eishe-emwe mutarikuryarya, mukundane munonga mwihire aha mutima. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:13">Yoh 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba mukaheza kuzaarwa obwa kabiri, mutazairwe mbibo erikujunda, kureka etarikujunda, nikyo kigambo kya Ruhanga ekihuriire kandi ekigumaho; <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa 40:6-8</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Emibiri yoona eba nk'obunyaatsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">N'oburungi bwayo buba nk'orurabyo rw'obunyaatsi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Obunyaatsi buhonga, n'orurabyo ruhunduura,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Kwonka ekigambo kya Ruhanga kigumaho ebiro byona. Kandi ekigambo ekyo nibwo butumwa burungi obu mwagambiirwe.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Eibaare eryayangirwe abantu ery'obuguzi bwingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 1:21">Yak 1:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mujuure eitima ryona n'obugobya bwona n'oburyarya bwona n'eihari ryona n'okubeiherera abandi kwona. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Mube nk'abaana abeereere, mwetengye amate g'Omwoyo agatafungwire, gabakuze, gabahitsye aha kujunwa, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Zab 34:8</ref>. </char></note> ku muraabe mwarorize aha mbabazi za Mukama waitu.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zab 118:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwije ahariwe, niwe ibaare erihuriire, eryayangirwe abantu, kwonka ahari Ruhanga eritoorainwe, ery'obuguzi bwingi; <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />kandi naimwe nk'amabaare agahuriire mwombekirwe okuba enju y'omwoyo, n'oruganda rw'abanyamurwa abarikwera ab'okutamba ebitambo by'Omwoyo ebirikusiimwa Ruhanga ahabwa Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ahakuba omu Byahandiikirwe kikahandiikwa ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Reeba, ninta omuri Saayuuni eibaare ry'obuhamizo bw'enju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Eritoorainwe ery'obuguzi bwingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Kandi orikumwikiriza tarikwatwa nshoni.<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo ahariimwe abarikwikiriza n'Ow'obuguzi bwingi, kwonka aha batarikwikiriza kikahandiikwa ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">Eibaare eri abombeki baayangire</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">Niryo ryahindukire ery'obuhamizo bw'enju;<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Rom 9:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> kandi ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">N'eibaare eriteeza abantu entsibo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">N'orukiri orubagwisa,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">bateera entsibo, ahabw'okuba tiboorobera kigambo, nk'oku baakiteereirweho ira.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:18">Byak 26:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:6">Kush 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka imwe muri oruganda orutoorainwe, n'abanyamurwa b'obukama, eihanga eririkwera, abantu abu Ruhanga yaayetooraniire, ngu mubone kworeka oburungi bw'Owaabeetsire okuruga omu mwirima, okutaaha omu mushana gwe ogurikutangaaza. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Ira mukaba mutari ihanga, kwonka hati muri eihanga rya Ruhanga; ira mukaba mutasaasiirwe, mbwenu hati musaasiirwe.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:24">Gal 5:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarikukundwa, nimbeeshengyereza nk'abagyenyi kandi abagyenzi, mwerinde okwetenga okubi okw'omubiri okutuura nikurwanisa amagara gaanyu, <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:13">Yak 3:13</ref>. </char></note> mugire emicwe mirungi omu Banyamahanga, kandi ku baraaze kubagambuura nibabeeta enkozi z'ebibi, bareebe ebirungi ebi murikukora, bahimbise Ruhanga omu bunaku bw'okutaayaayirwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:1">Tit 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Ahabwa Mukama mworobere obutegyeki bwona obw'abantu, yaaba buri obw'omugabe nk'omutwe gwa boona, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />nari obw'abategyeki nk'abatairweho Ogwo kuhana enkozi z'ebibi, n'okusiima abarikukora gye. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:16">1 Pet 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba eki Ruhanga akunda n'eki ngu okukora gye kwanyu kubumbe akanwa k'abashema babure eky'okubagambaho omu butamanya bwabo. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:13">Gal 5:13</ref>. </char></note> Mugire obusingye, kwonka obusingye bwanyu mutabukoresa nk'eky'okushwekyerera obubi, kureka mube abahuuku ba Ruhanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Muhe abantu boona ekitiinisa. Mukunde ab'eishe-emwe. Mutiine Ruhanga. Muhe omugabe ekitiinisa.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo eky'okureeberaho kyaitu omu kubonabona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5">Efe 6:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abahuuku, mworobere bakama baanyu nimubaha ekitiinisa kyona, ti barungi n'abarikutwaza gye bonka, kureka n'abanyamwaga nabo. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ahakuba omuntu asiimwa, yaagumisiririza obusaasi naaturwa busha, ahabw'okugira omutima murungi ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 Pet 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:13">4:13</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 4:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nimusiimwa ki, ku muraabe nimuteerwa ahabw'okukora kubi mukagumisiriza? Kwonka ku murikukora gye, mwabonabonesibwa, mukagumisiriza, ekyo nikyo kirikusiimwa ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:15">Yoh 13:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nikyo mwayeteirwe, ahakuba na Kristo akabonabonesibwa ahabwanyu, yaabatsigira eky'okureeberaho, ngu mutoore omuhanda ogu yaarabiremu. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53:9</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Kor 5:21</ref>. </char></note> We tarakozire kibi; n'omu kanwa ke tihararugiremu bugobya. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Ku yaajumirwe, tiyaabagarurira; ku yaabonabonesiibwe, tiyaabahayira, kureka akeehayo ahari Ogwo ocwa emanja z'amazima. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:11">Rom 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:28">Heb 9:28</ref>. </char></note> Niwe yaayekoreire ebibi byaitu omu mubiri gwe aha muti, ngu itwe abaherize kufa aha bibi, tugire amagara omu kuhikiirira. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba mukaba nimuhaba nk'entaama, kwonka hati mugarukire aha Muriisa kandi Omureeberezi w'amagara gaanyu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize mirungi y'Abakristaayo omu maka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naimwe abakazi, mworobere mutyo baabaroimwe; ku haraabe hariho abatarikworobera kigambo kya Ruhanga, bahindurwe emitwarize y'abakazi baabo, bataine kigambo kyona eki babagambiire, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />ahabw'okureeba emitwarize yaanyu mirungi ey'okutiina Ruhanga.<verse eid="1PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:18-24">Isa 3:18-24</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Tim 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwecuma kwanyu kurekye kuba okw'aharuguru, okw'okutisba eishokye, n'okujwara eby'ezaabu, n'okujwara ebijwaro ebiragaize aha bigyere, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />kureka okwecuma kwanyu kube okw'omunda omu mutima, okw'ekijwaro ekitasiisikara eky'omwoyo omucureezi ogutuurize ogw'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />N'abakazi abarikwera aba ira, abaabaire baine amatsiko ahari Ruhanga, nikwo baabaire beecuma, niboorobera baibabo; <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Kut 18:12</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku Saara yaabaire ayorobera Abrahamu, naamweta mukama we. Naimwe hati muri bahara be, ku muraabe nimukora gye, mutaine kirikubatiinisa.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naimwe abashaija, mugume mutyo n'abakazi baanyu, nk'abarikwetegyereza ebishemeire, nimubaha ekitiinisa, ahakuba ni nk'enyabya zitagumire, kandi n'abahunguzi abakwataniise naimwe omu magara agu mwahereirwe busha, okushaba kwanyu kurekye kugira ekyakuzibira.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Eky'aha muheru mwena mukwatanise omu mwoyo, musaasirane, mukundane nk'eishe-emwe, mugirirane embabazi n'omutima omucureezi. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:23">1 Pet 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Murekye kwihurana ebibi, nari okugarurirana ebijumo; kureka omu mwanya gw'ebyo mushabirane omugisha; manya nikyo mwayeteirwe ngu muhungure omugisha. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Zab 34:12-16</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">Orikwenda kukunda amagara ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">N'okugira obusingye omu biro bye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">Ashemereire kuzibira orurimi rwe kugamba kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">N'eminwa ye kugamba eby'obugobya;<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Kandi ahindukye arugye omu bubi, akore ebirungi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">Asherure obusingye, kandi abukuratire.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 16:9">2 Bus 16:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba amaisho ga Mukama agata aha bahikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">N'amatu ge agatega okushaba kwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Kwonka abarikukora kubi abateera ekitsyori.<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Mbwenu n'oha oribakora kubi, ku muraabe nimwezirika kukora ebirungi? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ku muraabe nimuhiigwa ahabw'okuhikiirira, muhiiriirwe. Mutaritiina okukangisa kwabo, kandi mutaryemereza omutima; <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />kureka muhe Kristo ekitiinisa nka Mukama omu mitima yaanyu. Mugume mweteekateekire kushobororera omuntu weena orikubashobooroza eby'amatsiko agu mwine, kwonka mubashobororere n'obucureezi n'okutiina Ruhanga, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />n'omutima ogutarikweshinja, ngu omuri ebyo ebi murikugambwaho kubi, abarikujuma emitwarize yaanyu mirungi ey'omuri Kristo bakwatwe enshoni. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:20-24">1 Pet 2:20-24</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ni kirungi okubonabonesibwa ahabw'okukora gye, Ruhanga ku araabe naakisiima, okukira okubonabonesibwa ahabw'okukora kubi. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:28">Heb 9:28</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba na Kristo akabonabonesibwa rimwe ahabw'ebibi yaaheza, Ohikiriire ahabw'abatahikiriire, ngu atureete ahari Ruhanga, yaitwa omu mubiri, kwonka yaahindurwa ohuriire omu mwoyo, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />ou yaagyendeiremu okubuurira emyoyo ey'omu kihome, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />ey'abantu abatarahuriire Ruhanga ira, obu yaagumisiriza omu biro bya Noa, nibakikora emeeri, ei abantu bakye munaana bakiriiremu amaizi. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Amaizi ago nikyo kishushani ky'ago agabakiza omu kubatizibwa, ti kwihaho nziro z'omubiri, kureka n'endagaano y'omutima ogutarikweshinja ahari Ruhanga, kandi ebajuna ahabw'okuzooka kwa Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:20">Efe 1:20</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 1:21">21</ref>. </char></note> owaagiire omu iguru, ari aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa Ruhanga, naategyeka baamaraika n'abategyeki n'ab'obushoboorozi.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:7">Rom 6:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo nk'oku Kristo yaabonabonesiibwe omu mubiri, naimwe muhagatire eby'okurwanisa, nigwo mutima nk'ogwe; ahakuba oherize kubonabonesibwa omu mubiri, biri aherize kureka ebibi, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:16">1 Yoh 2:16</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 2:17">17</ref>. </char></note> mubone kumara ebiro ebi mutsigaize omu magara g'omubiri, mutarikukora by'okurigira okubi kw'abantu, kureka ebi Ruhanga akunda. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 2:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Murekye ebiro ebyahingwire bimare, ebi mwakoreiremu ebi Abanyamahanga bakunda, okugyendera omu micwe mibi ey'obushambani, n'okwetenga okubi, n'obusinzi, n'okuraara enkyera, n'okunywa amaarwa maingi, n'emizizo mibi ey'okuramya ebishushani. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ekirikubatangaaza n'okureeba mutarikurahuka kukwatanisa nabo omu burare obuhinguraine; nikyo barikubajumira. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:42">Byak 10:42</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka baryatonganisibwa Ogwo oyeteekateekire kucwa orubanja rw'abahuriire n'abafiire. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:19">1 Pet 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo engiri yaagambiriirwe n'abaafiire, ngu bacwerwe orubanja nk'abantu oku barucwerwa, babone kugira amagara omu mwoyo nka Ruhanga.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Emperu ya byona eri haihi; n'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde, muhuguukye, mwezirikire kushaba. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:22">1 Pet 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:7">1 Kor 13:7</ref>. </char></note> Okukira byona mukundane munonga; ahabw'okuba okukunda kushweka ebibi bingi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mukunirane mutarikunyomwa; <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:42">Luk 12:42</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku omuntu weena yaahairwe ekiconco, mube nikwo mwabihweresana, nk'ababiiki barungi ab'embabazi za Ruhanga ez'emiringo yoona; <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:7">Rom 12:7</ref>. </char></note> orikugamba agambe nk'orikugamba ebi ashuururiirwe Ruhanga; orikuheereza aheereze n'amani agu Ruhanga amuhaire, Ruhanga abone kuhimbisibwa omuri byona ahabwa Yesu Kristo; aheebwe ekitiinisa n'obutegyeki ebiro byona Amiina.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugumya abarikubonabonesibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Abarikukundwa, mutatangaazibwa omuriro ogwizire kubagyeza, nk'abahikwaho eihano; <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:41">Byak 5:41</ref>. </char></note> kureka mushemererwe ahabw'okukwatanisa na Kristo omu busaasi bwe; kandi ekitiinisa kye ku kirishuuruurwa, nabwo mushemererwe n'okwesiima kwingi. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:20">1 Pet 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:51">Zab 89:51</ref>. </char></note> Ku muraabe nimujumwa ahabw'okuturwa eiziina rya Kristo, muhiiriirwe, ahabw'okuba Omwoyo ow'ekitiinisa kandi owa Ruhanga atuura ahariimwe. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Kwonka hatarigira omuntu omuriimwe owaabonabonesibwa ahabw'okwita, nari okwiba, nari okukora kubi, nari okweta omu by'abandi; <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:26">Byak 11:26</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omuntu ku araabonabonesibwe nk'omukristaayo, arekye kukwatwa enshoni, kureka ahimbise Ruhanga ahabw'eiziina eryo. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:6">Ezk 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba obunaku buhikire orubanja okutandikira aha b'omu nju ya Ruhanga; mbwenu ku ruraabe nirubandiza ahariitwe, omuheru gw'abatoorobera ngiri ya Ruhanga guryaba guta? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Kandi abahikiriire ku baraagumirwe okujunwa, abatatiina Ruhanga n'abasiisi baryaba bata? <verse eid="1PE 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />N'ahabw'ekyo abarikubonabona nk'oku Ruhanga akunda, bagume nibakora gye, kandi bakwatse amagara gaabo Omuhangi orikwesigwa.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Oku abakuru bashemereire kutegyeka ekanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:17">Rom 8:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu niinyehanangiriza abakuru omuriimwe, nk'omukuru mugyenzi waanyu, kareebi w'okubonabona kwa Kristo, kandi okwataniise naimwe ekitiinisa ekirishuuruurwa; <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:28">Byak 20:28</ref>. </char></note> Muriise gye obusyo bwa Ruhanga, obu mwakwatsiibwe, mutaburiisa nk'abagyemirwe, kureka muburiise mweyendeire nk'oku Ruhanga arikukunda; ti habw'omururu mubi gw'okutunga ebintu, kureka mwine omutima ogurikukunda, <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:7">Tit 2:7</ref>. </char></note> murekye kutegyekyesa eikama obusyo obu mwakwatsiibwe, kureka mube eky'okureeberaho aharibwo. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Bwanyima Omuriisa omukuru ku aryorekwa, muryaheebwa ekirunga ky'ekitiinisa ekitarikuhunduuka. <verse eid="1PE 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:21">Efe 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:4">Yoh 13:4</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 13:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo naimwe abato mworobere abakuru. Mwena mwezirikye obucureezi, mubone kuheerezana; ahakuba Ruhanga arwanisa ab'amaryo, kwonka abacureezi abaha omugisha.<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:29">Yob 22:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mwecureeze ahansi y'omukono gwa Ruhanga ogw'amaani, obunaku ku burihika abatunguure. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 55:22">Zab 55:22</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Mumwegyekyerere okushoberwa kwanyu kwona, ahabw'okuba naabataho omutima. <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:7">Yak 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Mwerinde; mugume nimureeba. Sitaane omuzigu waanyu naashooba nk'entare erikutsinda, naasherura ou araarye. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Mumurwanise, muhamire omu kwikiriza kwanyu, nimumanya ngu ab'eishe-emwe abari omu nsi yoona nabo bahikwaho obusaasi nk'obwanyu. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:6">1 Pet 1:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ruhanga ow'embabazi zoona, owaabeeteire ekitiinisa kye ekitahwaho omuri Kristo, ku muriheza kubonabonesibwa akaanya kakye, aryabagarura busya, abagumye, abahe amaani. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Aheebwe obutegyeki ebiro n'ebiro. Amiina. <verse eid="1PE 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Naabahandiikira nincwera ahagufu, nimpandiikisa Siluwano, ow'eishe-emwe orikwesigwa, nk'oku ndikuteekateeka; nimbeehanangiriza, kandi nimpamya ngu ezi nizo mbabazi za Ruhanga ez'amazima; mube nizo mwahamiramu. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Ekanisa ya Babulooni eyaatoorainwe nkaimwe yaabaramutsya; kandi na Mako omwana wangye yaabaramutsya. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Muramukanise okunywegyera kw'okukunda. Mugume n'obusingye, imwe mwena abari omuri Kristo.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>